  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></math> is divisible by"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "neither&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math>&nbsp;nor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>34</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math>&nbsp;but not by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>34</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>34</mn></math>&nbsp;but not by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>34</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></math> are divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will give remainder as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will give remainder as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;divided&nbsp;by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, so combined&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will give remainder&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> are divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is even,&nbsp;<br />So given number is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>34</mn></math>&nbsp;as it is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>17</mn></math>&nbsp;both,</p><p>Now,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>190</mn></msup></math>, dividing by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>95</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>95</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>31</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>31</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;will give remainder as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>190</mn></msup></math>, when divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>63</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>63</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>63</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;will give remainder as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Similarly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>190</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will give&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;remainder&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>63</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will give&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;remainder,</p><p>So combining all we get,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>190</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Not divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>, so it will not be divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}